    "summary": {
      "en": "An Oghuz Turkic dynasty that conquered Iran, entered Baghdad in 1055 as protector of the Abbasid caliph and defeated Byzantium at Manzikert. Under the vizier Nizam al-Mulk it sponsored madrasas and a Sunni revival; it fragmented after 1092, and the last sultan in Iraq fell in 1194.",
      "zh": "乌古斯突厥王朝，征服伊朗，1055年以阿拔斯哈里发保护者身份进入巴格达，并在曼齐刻尔特击败拜占庭。在宰相尼扎姆·穆勒克主持下兴办经学院、推动逊尼派复兴；1092年后分裂，1194年伊拉克的末代苏丹败亡。"
